[00:10.56] A windy day, the cars in slow formation
[00:19.92] Not far away a final destination
[00:26.67] One mother's son
[00:29.33] His father's distant gaze regretting
[00:32.98] Where they went wrong
[00:35.52] He always found it too upsetting
[00:39.74] Me and my friend
[00:42.62] We lived our lives completely
[00:46.31] From start to end
[00:48.96] You and your friend so sweetly
[00:52.86] With strength and pride
[00:56.55] In spite of everything and swimming
[00:59.51] Against the tide
[01:01.97] To obstinately hope of winning
[01:05.72] And, at the end, your funny uncle staring
[01:15.79] At all your friends with military bearing
[01:22.33] And stopped to stand
[01:25.02] To smile and speak of you directly
[01:28.97] 'Good-bye', shake hands
[01:31.79] Like you did everything correctly
[01:35.80] To wipe away the tears
[01:41.51] No more pain, no fear
[01:46.02] No sorrow or dying
[01:48.72] No waiting or crying
[01:51.90] These former things have passed away
[01:56.39] Another life begins today
